MATLAB UTILITY ROUTINES

cd ~/Dropbox/matlabUtilities

(*) printArray.m                       : Output an array to a file in a nice format 

(*) initPolyTZ.m, polyTZ.m, testPoly.m : polynomial twilight zone (manufactured solutions)

(*) trigTZ.m, testTrig.m               : trigonometric twilight zone (manufactured solutions)

(*) assignCommandLineOption.m          : read command line options

(*) clearOpenFigures.m                 : clear a list of open figures (often placed near the top of a main routine)

(*) savePlotFile.m                     : Save a matlab plot as a pdf (uses /usr/local/bin/ps2pdf to crop the file)

